      "inputTokens": 73,
      "outputTokens": 560,
      "costUsd": 0.0050765,
      "pronunciationText": "Here's a way to remember the signs. Differentiating moves one step forward around this wheel: sine, cos, minus sine, minus cos, and back to sine. Integrating moves one step back. One step back from sine is minus cos. One step back from cos is sine. Sec squared isn't on the wheel. It comes from tan."
